            <ArticleTitle>[Tl-201 scintigraphy of the myocardium in combination with pharmacological tests in the diagnosis of ischemic heart disease].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>73-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The paper presents the results from examination of 67 patients with coronary heart disease verified by coronary angiography. Sixty three patients had a bicycle ergometric tests, 48 underwent 201Tl myocardial scintigraphy along with a dipyridamole test, 19, the scintigraphy in combination with an isoproterenol test. The feasibilities of employing the procedures in the diagnosis of coronary heart disease were compared by statistic analysis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
